# A100 TeraDesk via #Z (sd-tera): the AES-side change alone (no frame repaint
# after a hover toggle) on a box that already has the outside border
# (desktop.rsc tree 0 object 9, ob_spec 0xFF1100). A: idle. File title
# (88,8) -> B: box down. Hover "Select all" (120,155) -> C: after = the item
# inverted, frame untouched; before = rehilite painted a second frame along
# the box rectangle's own edges inside the outer one. Out, click = cancel,
# park -> D.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 88 8
1900 mark B_FILE_OPEN
2200 move 120 155
2700 mark C_ENTRY_HOVER
3000 move 400 300
3300 down
3303 up
3800 parkbr
4300 mark D_CLOSED
